    "about": {
      "heading": "Clear advice. Complicated files. Repeat business.",
      "body": [
        "Tony Barletta Jr. is a licensed mortgage loan originator, NMLS #18717, serving clients from Massachusetts with licenses in 22 states. Public profiles describe two decades in the business, including branch leadership, and a practice built on referrals through both high and low points in the market.",
